        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3930053710938,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "4.\t Decentralization should be prioritized for settings and populations with poor access to existing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        289.8568115234375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "services and/or in high TB-prevalence areas.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        98.04273223876953,
        527.5828857421875,
        112.48573303222656
      ],
      "text": "5.\t  Family-centred, integrated approaches are recommended as an additional option to standard TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        111.24268341064453,
        527.581298828125,
        125.68568420410156
      ],
      "text": "services (e.g. alongside specialized services that may have a limited level of integration with other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990845680236816,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        124.44263458251953,
        306.9838562011719,
        138.88563537597656
      ],
      "text": "programmes or links to general health services).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.89454650878906,
        510.7908630371094,
        156.33753967285156
      ],
      "text": "6.\t Family-centred care is a cross-cutting principle of child care at all levels of the health system.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.59852600097656,
        527.4410400390625,
        178.04151916503906
      ],
      "text": "This section contains two recommendations on the implementation of decentralized models of care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        176.7985382080078,
        527.4034423828125,
        191.2415313720703
      ],
      "text": "and integrated family-centred models of care to improve both case detection and the provision of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.99855041503906,
        212.69020080566406,
        204.44154357910156
      ],
      "text": "TB preventive treatment (TPT).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        211.70240783691406,
        527.6171875,
        226.14540100097656
      ],
      "text": "Capacity for paediatric TB is often highly centralized at secondary/tertiary levels, where children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        224.9025421142578,
        527.3861083984375,
        239.3455352783203
      ],
      "text": "may present as seriously ill, after delays in accessing care. At higher levels of care services are often",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.82643127441406,
        527.5216064453125,
        252.54542541503906
      ],
      "text": "(135, 136) managed in a vertical, non-integrated way  . Health-care workers at the primary health care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.998649597167969,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.3024444580078,
        527.3959350585938,
        265.7454528808594
      ],
      "text": "(PHC) level may have limited capacity for and confidence in managing paediatric TB, although this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.22637939453125,
        527.4310913085938,
        278.9454040527344
      ],
      "text": "(136) is the level at which most children with TB or at risk of TB seek care  . In addition, TB screening is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.702392578125,
        527.481689453125,
        292.1454162597656
      ],
      "text": "often not systematically part of clinical algorithms for child health – such as integrated management of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965897560119629,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.90252685546875,
        527.5433959960938,
        305.3455505371094
      ],
      "text": "childhood illness (IMCI) or integrated community case management (iCCM). Private-sector providers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99644947052002,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.826416015625,
        527.453857421875,
        318.5454406738281
      ],
      "text": "(137) play an increasing role as the first point of care in many countries  . Nevertheless, there are many",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.99739933013916,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.30242919921875,
        527.0828857421875,
        331.7454528808594
      ],
      "text": "missed opportunities for contact-tracing, as well as for TB prevention, detection and care, because of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995498657226562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.5024108886719,
        486.3021240234375,
        344.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": "weak integration of child and adolescent TB services with other programmes and services.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.2064208984375,
        527.3947143554688,
        366.6494445800781
      ],
      "text": "Decentralization and provision of family-centred, integrated care are highlighted as one of 10 key",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        364.1304016113281,
        527.413818359375,
        379.84942626953125
      ],
      "text": "Roadmap towards ending TB in children and adolescents (136) actions in the 2018  . The Roadmap",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.6064147949219,
        527.4256591796875,
        393.0494384765625
      ],
      "text": "highlights that consistently and systematically addressing gaps and bottlenecks along children’s and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.806396484375,
        527.4266357421875,
        406.2494201660156
      ],
      "text": "adolescents’ pathway through TB exposure, infection and disease can lead to reduced transmission",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.00640869140625,
        527.428955078125,
        419.4494323730469
      ],
      "text": "of TB, expanded prevention of TB infection and earlier TB diagnosis with better outcomes. Achieving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.2064208984375,
        527.411376953125,
        432.6494445800781
      ],
      "text": "this continuum of care requires collaboration across service areas, practice disciplines and sectors,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.4064025878906,
        527.4012451171875,
        445.84942626953125
      ],
      "text": "and community engagement, as well as decentralization and integration of service delivery at the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.3304138183594,
        145.35140991210938,
        459.0494384765625
      ],
      "text": "(136) PHC level  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.310302734375,
        524.3963012695312,
        480.7533264160156
      ],
      "text": "The Roadmap suggests actions to integrate child and adolescent TB into family- and community-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.51031494140625,
        194.56883239746094,
        493.9533386230469
      ],
      "text": "centred care, including by:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.2142333984375,
        78.23609924316406,
        515.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        501.2142333984375,
        527.4036254882812,
        515.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "strengthening country-level collaboration and coordination across all health-related programmes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        514.4141845703125,
        527.0704956054688,
        528.857177734375
      ],
      "text": "engaged in woman, adolescent and child health – especially reproductive health, maternal, neonatal,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        527.6143188476562,
        527.4069213867188,
        542.0573120117188
      ],
      "text": "child and adolescent health (MNCAH), nutrition, HIV, primary and community health – with clearly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        540.814208984375,
        328.67547607421875,
        555.2572021484375
      ],
      "text": "defined roles, responsibilities and joint accountability;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.01416015625,
        78.23609924316406,
        568.4571533203125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        554.01416015625,
        527.2140502929688,
        568.4571533203125
      ],
      "text": "decentralizing and integrating successful models of care for TB screening, prevention and diagnosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968003273010254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        567.2142333984375,
        527.2972412109375,
        581.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "with other existing service delivery platforms for maternal and child health – such as antenatal care,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97426986694336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        580.4141845703125,
        468.79345703125,
        594.857177734375
      ],
      "text": "iCCM and IMCI – as well as other related services (e.g. HIV, nutrition, immunization);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.6143188476562,
        78.23609924316406,
        608.0573120117188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        593.6143188476562,
        527.433349609375,
        608.0573120117188
      ],
      "text": "ensuring that children and adolescents with other common co-morbidities (such as meningitis,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        606.8143310546875,
        523.3413696289062,
        621.25732421875
      ],
      "text": "malnutrition, pneumonia, chronic lung disease and HIV infection) are routinely evaluated for TB;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.0142211914062,
        78.23609924316406,
        634.4572143554688
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        620.0142211914062,
        527.0802001953125,
        634.4572143554688
      ],
      "text": "ensuring that community health strategies integrate child and adolescent TB education, screening,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989144325256348,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        633.2142333984375,
        431.8092956542969,
        647.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "prevention and case-finding into training and service delivery activities; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        646.4141845703125,
        78.23609924316406,
        660.857177734375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        646.4141845703125,
        527.3773803710938,
        660.857177734375
      ],
      "text": "increasing awareness of and demand for child and adolescent TB services in communities and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
